                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c09c07c-f518-44d3-a492-8651a9ea1744",
                        "source_entry_id": "3365f3c7-9f64-35c8-9cf9-9990d84a8af0",
                        "source_sense_description": "окаменелость",
                        "target_lang_word": "devil's finger",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "devil's finger",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5dcbe09c-2302-3517-887d-8a5ae7050295",
                                        "entry_id": "b10aab24-32fd-3355-b7ef-6f057c5c2c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A belemnite, any of various extinct species of cephalopod in the order Belemnitida."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "baf2d2a5-4862-3b50-95db-18cd963eca27",
                                        "entry_id": "b10aab24-32fd-3355-b7ef-6f057c5c2c62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fossil remains of such a cephalopod."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cd11ee8-9313-4f7b-90ca-174dceec17a4",
                                                "sense_id": "baf2d2a5-4862-3b50-95db-18cd963eca27",
                                                "text": "LXXVI. Belemnites, a conical or fusiform stone, of brown radiating spar, […] Various names have been assigned to this fossil; many of which, derived from the ridiculous notions entertained by the vulgar, in the early ages, need only be mentioned. Such are, devil’s fingers, Spectrorum candela, and idæus dactylus, from their having somewhat the form of fingers"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2312b07b-7429-4b50-8479-c8a03facfd98",
                                                "sense_id": "baf2d2a5-4862-3b50-95db-18cd963eca27",
                                                "text": "In the Middle Ages, when fields in the Norfolk chalk and Oxford clay outcrops of England were ploughed, they would appear after a thunderstorm. The myth soon emerged that they were thunderbolts. It is more likely that the heavy downpour had washed away the surrounding soil to reveal the fossils. Belemnites are also known as St Peter’s fingers, devil’s fingers and ghostly candles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3da936db-c9af-4ff2-9394-5ddff5254260",
                                                "sense_id": "baf2d2a5-4862-3b50-95db-18cd963eca27",
                                                "text": "Bivalves, a type of Jurassic oyster, are known as ‘devil’s toenails’ and the bullet shaped belemnites, which look like dinosaur teeth and are the remains of a creature resembling a cuttlefish, are, locally, called ‘devil’s fingers’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "08e8530b-1646-44b7-b1a5-7de0991ce2c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "3365f3c7-9f64-35c8-9cf9-9990d84a8af0",
                        "source_sense_description": "окаменелость",
                        "target_lang_word": "thunderbolt",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "thunderbolt",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f64f357-7184-3a4e-9a1c-3a6a5f1ce7b3",
                                        "entry_id": "d037d70c-feba-3b64-9b44-f3a269adbd47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flash of lightning accompanied by a crash of thunder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd4e8216-508f-4635-a9ea-56303af0fdb6",
                                                "sense_id": "3f64f357-7184-3a4e-9a1c-3a6a5f1ce7b3",
                                                "text": "News of the actress’s death came as a thunderbolt to her fans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83288293-c55f-44b9-a09b-8642d2df471e",
                                                "sense_id": "3f64f357-7184-3a4e-9a1c-3a6a5f1ce7b3",
                                                "text": "Our quiuering Lances ſhaking in the aire, / And bullets like Ioues dreadfull Thunderbolts, / Enrolde in flames and fiery ſmoldering miſtes, / Shall threat the Gods more than Cyclopian warres, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bb774ec-e85b-4b90-bace-7a631133bfe8",
                                                "sense_id": "3f64f357-7184-3a4e-9a1c-3a6a5f1ce7b3",
                                                "text": "And the sword that had visited Earth from so far away smote like the falling of thunderbolts [...] and the runes in Alveric’s far-travelled sword exulted, and roared at the elf-knight; until in the dark of the wood, amongst branches severed from disenchanted trees, with a blow like that of a thunderbolt riving an oak-tree, Alveric slew him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd628b72-8a11-407d-b178-763c5a9db5d3",
                                                "sense_id": "3f64f357-7184-3a4e-9a1c-3a6a5f1ce7b3",
                                                "text": "He describes the operation thus: \"The heavy ram employed to impart the finishing strokes, hoisted up with double purchase and snail's pace to the summit of the Piling Engine, and then falling down like a thunderbolt on the head of the devoted timber, driving it perhaps a single half inch in to the stratum below, is well calculated to put to the test the virtue of patience, while it illustrates the old adage of—slow and sure.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbab0f79-f15c-3d75-b790-348cf8b60b02",
                                        "entry_id": "d037d70c-feba-3b64-9b44-f3a269adbd47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event that is terrible, horrific or unexpected."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "979be0c7-4079-4602-8d4f-84474963af47",
                                                "sense_id": "fbab0f79-f15c-3d75-b790-348cf8b60b02",
                                                "text": "the Scipios' worth, those thunderbolts of war"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aad147e-7791-42d8-b481-ded618a33ec7",
                                                "sense_id": "fbab0f79-f15c-3d75-b790-348cf8b60b02",
                                                "text": "A greater wreck, a deeper fall, / A shock to one—a thunderbolt to all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ecc0f4c-ce38-37b6-b04f-07548fe74133",
                                        "entry_id": "d037d70c-feba-3b64-9b44-f3a269adbd47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vehement threatening or censure; especially, ecclesiastical denunciation; fulmination."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d73d51f9-3883-48ef-8f45-67de2e43bbf5",
                                                "sense_id": "5ecc0f4c-ce38-37b6-b04f-07548fe74133",
                                                "text": "a thunder-bolt of warre Striking all Nations"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f96fbe9e-ca22-37f7-b7c0-3c01f23e379d",
                                        "entry_id": "d037d70c-feba-3b64-9b44-f3a269adbd47",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very powerful shot."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56b8a158-ac6e-4000-8637-c8106fa8095a",
                                                "sense_id": "f96fbe9e-ca22-37f7-b7c0-3c01f23e379d",
                                                "text": "Substitute Niko Kranjcar's injury-time thunderbolt gave Tottenham a dramatic win over Bolton."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d61c7ca5-d44f-3bca-afd9-9b296322d4ef",
                                        "entry_id": "d037d70c-feba-3b64-9b44-f3a269adbd47",
                                        "glosses": [
